--------+---------------+------------+-----------------
      1 |               |          2 | statement block
      2 |             1 |          2 | IF
      3 |             2 |          1 | assignment
      4 |             2 |          1 | assignment
      5 |             1 |          2 | WHILE
      6 |             5 |         20 | assignment
      7 |             1 |          2 | RETURN
